From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Sheludko <ishell@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:40:59 +0100
Subject: [ic] Use StoreGlobalProxy handler for non-contextual stores to global

Ensure stores to existing properties on JSGlobalObject through
JSGlobalProxy use a StoreThroughPrototype handler with StoreGlobalProxy
so that access checks and prototype chain validity checks are enforced,
and remove the now-unused StoreHandler::StoreGlobal handler.

TAG=agy
CONV=de586dfb-b208-4009-af79-183febca17e6

Fixed: 574222006
Change-Id: I2c89603783851557ca5b412c1b609ab8d3996137
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8691329
Auto-Submit: Igor Sheludko <ishell@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Leszek Swirski <leszeks@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Leszek Swirski <leszeks@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#111486}

